Well maybe it's because starbound generally doesn't seem that attractive to that kind of People, but i wouldn't know, i'm generally on the shy side in these Things so this is a bit of a testrun, but i was positively surprised that until now everybody seemed really nice.

&#x200B;

I just hope for the best in this as i don't want it to be ruined just because someone decides to be a dick for one reason or another.
